  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "$x>0$일 때, $\\sqrt[4]{\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{x}}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}}\\times\\sqrt[3]{\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}}\\times\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}}$ 를 간단히 하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$\\sqrt[16]{x^3}$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$$\\sqrt[4]{\\dfrac{\\sqrt[3]{x}}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}}\\times\\sqrt[3]{\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt[4]{x}}}\\times\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt[3]{x}}}$$\n$$=\\dfrac{\\sqrt[12]{x}}{\\sqrt[16]{x}}\\times\\dfrac{\\sqrt[6]{x}}{\\sqrt[12]{x}}\\times\\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{x}}{\\sqrt[6]{x}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt[4]{x}}{\\sqrt[16]{x}}$$\n$$=\\dfrac{x^{\\frac{1}{4}}}{x^{\\frac{1}{16}}}=x^{\\frac{4}{16}-\\frac{1}{16}}=\\sqrt[16]{x^3}\\ \\text{이다.}$$",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
