  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "$\\left\\{\\left(\\dfrac{27}{125}\\right)^{\\frac{5}{9}}\\right\\}^{\\frac{3}{5}}\\times\\left\\{\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^{-\\frac{5}{2}}\\right\\}^{\\frac{4}{5}}$ 의 값을 구하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$\\dfrac{27}{5}$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$$\\left\\{\\left(\\dfrac{27}{125}\\right)^{\\frac{5}{9}}\\right\\}^{\\frac{3}{5}}\\times\\left\\{\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^{-\\frac{5}{2}}\\right\\}^{\\frac{4}{5}}$$\n$$=\\left(\\dfrac{27}{125}\\right)^{\\frac{5}{9}\\times\\frac{3}{5}}\\times\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^{-\\frac{5}{2}\\times\\frac{4}{5}}$$\n$$=\\left(\\dfrac{27}{125}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\times\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^{-2}=\\left\\{\\left(\\dfrac{3}{5}\\right)^3\\right\\}^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\times(3^{-1})^{-2}$$\n$$=\\dfrac{3}{5}\\times3^2=\\dfrac{27}{5}\\ \\text{이다.}$$",
  "parent": "",
